\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary Forint Strengthening Vs Dollar, Weakening Vs DEM \b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Januar 1997\par 11:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is strengthening against the dollar and weakening against the Deutsche mark Friday, with turnover levels average. \par \par \uc2  At 1034 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 168.86 to 168.91 forints, down from 169.04 to 169.09 forints in mid-session trading Thursday. They quoted the mark at 103.38 to 103.41 forints, up from 103.11 to 103.14 forints. \par \par \uc2  Trading ranges for the forint versus the dollar have been average during Friday's session, according to Jozsef Bodor, senior dealer at West LB Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The forint is trading against the dollar near its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. \par \par \uc2  'The forint started out against the dollar about 10 to 15 basis points from the bottom of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band, and since then has moved to between 20 and 25 basis points from the bottom,' Bodor said. \par \par \uc2  Such moves are normal on the market, although Bodor said the forint could weaken against the dollar, as the market in Budapest has been driven in recent days by the dollar's strengthening against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Thursday at 168.92 forints, down from 169.06 forints Wednesday. It fixed the mark at 103.15 forints Thursday, compared to 102.95 forints Wednesday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% mark. Friday's fixing will be released after 1100 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 22.11% Friday, compared to 22.15% at the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1045GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt1o00fw3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
