\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary's Forint Strengthening Vs Dollar, Steady Vs DEM \b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 1996\par 11:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is strengthening against the dollar and steady against the Deutsche mark in calm trading Friday. \par \par \uc2  At 1047 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 159.70 to 159.75 forints, down from 159.96 to 160.01 forints in mid-session trading Thursday. They quoted the mark at 103.50 to 103.54 forints, barely changed from 103.53 to 103.56 forints. \par \par \uc2  'There's low interest on the market today from buyers, but I wouldn't say there's much selling interest either,' said Szabolcs Brezina, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at K&H Bank in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  The forint has crept to a stronger position against the fixing basket over the past couple of days on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way from the midrate set by the bank. \par \par \uc2  At around 1042 GMT the forint was trading against the dollar at about 2.11% below the midrate on the band. Brezina said he expects the forint will reach its usual point near the strongest position on the band in January. The strongest position is 2.25% below the midrate. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Thursday at 163.24 forints, up from 162.86 forints Wednesday. It fixed the mark at 105.66 forints Thursday, compared to 105.64 forints Wednesday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% ECU. Friday's fixing will be released at 1200 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 22.39% Friday, compared to 22.30% at the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1051GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dscd01x4t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
