\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary's Forint Weakening Vs Dlr, Strengthening Vs DEM \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Dezember 1996\par 13:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening against the dollar and strengthening against the Deutsche mark in quiet trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  At 1043 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 159.87 to 159.92 forints, up from 159.41 to 159.51 forints in mid-session trading Friday. They quoted the mark at 103.08 to 103.11 forints, down from 103.44 to 103.54 forints. \par \par \uc2  Monday's subdued market is a switch from last week, when a mixture of market jumpiness and end-of-year factors led to wide swings in the forint against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  As it has since late November, the forint is trading against the dollar at a relatively weak point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way. \par \par \uc2  'It's not at all active, and it's very illiquid. I wouldn't even call it a market,' said Zsolt Tilimon, a dealer at Citibank in Budapest. 'There are only five or six banks which are really active today.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Friday at 162.44 forints, down from 163.64 forints Thursday. It fixed the mark at 105.53 forints Friday, compared to 104.78 forints Thursday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% ECU. Monday's fixing will be released at 1200 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Three month interbank forint offered rates are indicated at 22.29% Monday, compared to 22.31% at the previous session. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1213GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par 