\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary's Forint Strengthening Vs Dlr, Weakening Vs DEM \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Oktober 1996\par 12:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is strengthening against the dollar and weakening against the Deutsche mark in moderate trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  At 1103 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 155.58 to 155.63 forints, down from 155.72 to 155.77 forints in mid-session trading Friday. They quoted the mark at 102.12 to 102.15 forints, up from 102.05 to 102.08 forints. \par \par \uc2  The forint has slipped a fraction from its strongest point against the dollar on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band in trading Monday. But the forint is still trading near the bottom of the band, which is set at a maximum 2.25 points from the midrate. \par \par \uc2  On the open market, volume Monday is average, with no effect seen from reports of a possible shake-up at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  over a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  contract that may have cost the bank billions of forints, according to Mihaly Donka, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at BNP-Dresdner Bank Hungaria in Budapest. \par \par \uc2  'I don't think this will have any impact on the forint,' Donka said. 'It's not as if the finance minister were going to resign.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Friday at 159.24 forints, up from 158.93 forints Thursday. It fixed the mark at 104.36 forints Friday, compared with 104.63 forints Thursday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  unit (ECU). Monday's fixing will be released at 1200 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Forint three-month interest rates are indicated at 23.25% to 23.75% Monday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 28-10-96 \par \par \uc2  1123GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsas00fcm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
