\par\par \b \uc2  Hungary's Forint Weakening Vs Dlr, Strengthening Vs DEM \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 1996\par 14:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hungarian forint is weakening against the dollar and strengthening against the Deutsche mark in placid trading Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At 1221 GMT, traders quoted the dollar at 155.33 to 155.38 forints, up from 154.91 to 154.96 forints in mid-session trading Wednesday. They quoted the mark at 101.50 to 101.53 forints, down from 101.58 to 101.63 forints. \par \par \uc2  The forint is trading near its strongest point on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  band of 4.5%, which allows the forint to move 2.25% either way \par \par \uc2  Trading on the open market is calm, dealers said, with no apparent reaction to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's announcement that it would cut the interest rate on forint reserves of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings to 18% from 19.5% effective Oct. 16. \par \par \uc2  'As far as I see, it's a regular day,' said Jozsef Laczi, forint dealer at ING Bank in Budapest. 'There's low volume on the market. There really isn't very strong demand for the forint.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fixed the dollar Thursday at 158.91 forints, up from 158.30 forints Wednesday. It fixed the mark at 103.75 forints Thursday, compared to 103.86 forints Wednesday. The fixing basket is made up of 30% dollar and 70% ECU. \par \par \uc2  Forint three-month offered rates are indicated at 23.14% Thursday, compared to 23.13% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-10-96 \par \par \uc2  1240GMT \par \par \uc2  1168 1868 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013dsa307zsl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
