\par\par \b \uc2  Panic dollar-buying pushes Hungarian forint down. \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 April 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, April 25 (Reuter) - A spate of panic-buying of dollars in afternoon trade on the interbank market weakened the Hungarian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 30 pips inside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range, dealers said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The forint ended at 147.30/35 to one dollar, compared with its opening 146.85/90 and a midday level of 146.95/147.00. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bid stood at 147.05 at the close. \par \par \uc2  "The panic started after dealers started selling dollars as it strengthened in the morning but were then caught short in the afternoon," ING Bank's Attila Behan explained. "The buying back snowballed." \par \par \uc2  Behan expected the forint to stay at least 30 pips inside the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range tomorrow. Further weakening could lead to National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBH) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said. \par \par \uc2  "The NBH is already sniffing around. If (the forint) weakens another 30 pips I expect them to test the market." \par \par \uc2  The Italian lira remained the most actively traded instrument on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market of the Budapest Commodity Exchange with 18,000 out of a total 20,600 contracts. \par \par \uc2  Total turnover amounted to 2.1 billion forints, up from 1.6 billion on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -- Duncan Shiels, Budapest newsroom (361) 266 2410 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds4p08pc5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
