\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  FUTURES EASE ON BCE AFTER NBH  \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 August 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST Aug 30 (Reuter) - Most dollar futures prices dropped on the Budapest Commodity Exchange (BCE), as a result of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  yesterday on the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  spot market. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  yesterday to help the forint, ailed by falling interest rates. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar firmed on international markets but it was not enough (for the American unit) to climb back after its fall on the (domestic) market," said Jozsef Kaczur of AGP Rt. \par \par \uc2  Yen futures fell by around two forints as the Japanese unit weakened against the dollar in international markets, and players expected that it would ease further. \par \par \uc2  Mark futures prices dropped by between 40 fillers and one forint, influenced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the dollars firming. \par \par \uc2  The steep fall of overnight interest rates today to below 10 percent from above 26 percent yesterday did not influence \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures trade on the BCE as players expected the interst rates would rise again soon, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Interest rate futures did not attract attention today. "Players did not bid against offers at under 31 percent for next March and June maturities," Kaczur said. \par \par \uc2  - Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040129dr8u00kvu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngb