\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hungary central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to help forint. \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 August 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, Aug 29 (Reuter) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to help the forint, which had been undercut by falling interest rates, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The forint rose to 129.85/95 to the dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  against 130.55 before the midsession break, they added. \par \par \uc2  Gabor Butor of Unicbank said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was relatively small, somewhere between $10 million and $20 million, but was effective because the afternoon is usually slow on the market. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials declined to confirm or deny that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had taken place. \par \par \uc2  The forint had been pinned to the resistance level of its 4.5 percent wide trading range for months because its high interest rates, coupled with relatively slow, pre-announced, crawling-peg devaluations, offer attractive rates of return. \par \par \uc2  But the key overnight rates fell today to 26.125/25 percent against 28.25/50 percent yesterday and 30.5 percent a week ago. Some trades were conducted near 20 percent today. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ensures that the forint stays within its trading range through selling or buying unlimited amounts of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the support and resistance levels, respectively. But it was the first time that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the open market for more than a year. -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 24 10 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr8t04lpn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
