\par\par \b \uc2  FORINT FLUCTUATES AGAINST DOLLAR, LEAVES NBH BID. \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, AUg 17 (Reuter) - The forint eased against the dollar in the afternoon trade, tracking the movements of the dollar/mark cross, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The forint was quoted at 129.80/90 at 14.00 (local time) against its open at 129.45/50 and yesterday's close at 128.80/90. \par \par \uc2  At noon, the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  (NBH) set the midpoint of its 4.5 floating \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range to 132.78, compared to 131.98 yesterday. The NBH bid was calculated at 129.79. \par \par \uc2  When the mark gained strength against the dollar in the morning, the forint also firmed, but it fell again when the dollar drove the mark's surge back in the afternoon, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The limits of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range are determined by a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , made up of 70 percent ECU and 30 percent dollar. \par \par \uc2  "The forint moved in a range near the NBH bid, first a little bit farther from the resistance, than close to it again," said Andras Pongracz of Altalanos Ertekforgalmi Bank. \par \par \uc2  "The forint probably moved away from the NBH bid, because client orders of the banks met speculation," he added. \par \par \uc2  -- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020040129dr8h00jtl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
