\par\par \b \uc2  Banks unload  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  after forint devaluation. \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUDAPEST, March 13 (Reuter) - After a nine percent devaluation announced Sunday and effective today, the Hungarian forint closed at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's new bid rate as banks unloaded their long \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions following a forint devaluation, dealers said. But there was no clear picture of rate movements this morning as banks were barely able to make a market amongst themselves as almost of them were intent on selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and the only buyer was the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The forint ended midsession at 117.38/45 to the dollar, against Friday's 112.15/20 close. \par \par \uc2  That put the forint slightly weaker than today's 117.25/35 open, but that did not reflect the trend of speuclators cashing in profits on the long-anticipated devaluation. \par \par \uc2  "Everybody tried to get out of their positions, resulting sales (of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) to National Bank of Hungary," MBFB dealer Zita Verner said. \par \par \uc2  "The NBH's price was better than the market rate," she added. \par \par \uc2  By the midsession break the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bid rate stood at 117.42. Shortly later the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Hungary\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the midpoint of its 4.5 percent-wide \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  range at 120.03. \par \par \uc2  Last Friday the midrate was 109.63. \par \par \uc2  The market is expected to stay where it is now for the rest of the week, she said. "We'll stay here. Everybody touched the floor, and now it will be interesting to see where forint rates would go," Verner said. \par \par \uc2  The impact of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales will be felt on the money market only from Thursday, but dealers differed whether tax payments and reserve accumulation requirements would then help bring rates down. \par \par \uc2  -- Emil Varadi, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266-24-10 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr3d00axe\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (hungary near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2